```java
int a = 10;
int b = 4;
boolean c = a != b;    		// true
boolean d = a != 10;       // false
```

```java
int a = 10;
int b = 4;
boolean c = a < b; 	// false
```

```java
int a = 10;
int b = 4;
boolean c = a > b; 	// true
```

