class Program{
      
    public static void main(String[] args) {

        DayTime current = DayTime.MORNING;
		System.out.println(current);	// MORNING
    }
}
enum DayTime{

    MORNING,
    AFTERNOON,
    EVENING,
    NIGHT
}
```

